of language structure in general.

315
00:36:59,460 --> 00:37:04,249
You will discover that certain
constructions in one language

316
00:37:04,249 --> 00:37:09,397
you just can’t translate.

317
00:37:09,397 --> 00:37:29,079
I was once asked what were the
most vital assets of a competent

318
00:37:29,349 --> 00:37:44,260
programmer, and I said, at the time,
a mathematical inclination and an

319
00:37:44,260 --> 00:37:46,540
