323
00:38:04,660 --> 00:38:21,520
And I said “native tongue” and not
“English” because, well for lack

324
00:38:21,570 --> 00:38:38,450
of formalism, you have to think in
terms of words and sentences using

325
00:38:38,450 --> 00:38:43,910
a language you are familiar with.

326
00:38:46,200 --> 00:38:54,009
Moreover, but I didn’t know that at the
time, research has shown that when people

327
00:38:54,009 --> 00:39:02,290
acquire a second language, they never
get a greater mastery of it than they

328
00:39:02,710 --> 00:39:06,549
have of their own language, their native
tongue: that clearly sets the standard

329
00:39:06,790 --> 00:39:17,909
