330
00:39:18,299 --> 00:39:20,350
I know I’ve interrupted
your chronology here.

331
00:39:21,010 --> 00:39:23,580
For frame of reference, how far
away are we from the beginning

332
00:39:23,580 --> 00:39:27,520
