333
00:39:27,750 --> 00:39:28,740
Ten years.

334
00:39:29,580 --> 00:39:30,360
Ten years later?

335
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:30,385
Yes.

336
00:39:30,385 --> 00:39:30,462
That started in…

337
00:39:30,462 --> 00:39:30,488
’69

338
00:39:30,488 --> 00:39:30,514
?
 Yes.

339
00:39:30,540 --> 00:39:47,670
’69, and we were at ’59 in Paris.

340
00:39:52,360 --> 00:40:00,790
One of the main things that I
remember from that was that Alan

