357
00:41:24,615 --> 00:41:24,621
Oh yes?

358
00:41:24,621 --> 00:41:24,635
They are still in touch.

359
00:41:24,635 --> 00:41:24,641
They are?

360
00:41:24,641 --> 00:42:10,470
Now then, ALGOL 60 came, which in
